    "slides": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "text": "You sit on your floor at thirty-two, surrounded by half-unpacked boxes, holding a photograph of your mother at thirty-two in her own half-painted kitchen.",
        "closing": false,
        "text_tone": "LIGHT",
        "logo_tone": "LIGHT",
        "footer_tone": "NAVY",
        "accent": "GOLD"
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "text": "As a child, that kitchen felt like an established world, anchored by someone who knew precisely what Tuesday required.",
        "closing": false,
        "text_tone": "LIGHT",
        "logo_tone": "LIGHT",
        "footer_tone": "NAVY",
        "accent": "GOLD"
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "text": "Looking closely now, you see the familiar tension in her shoulders that you recognized in your mirror this morning.",
        "closing": false,
        "text_tone": "LIGHT",
        "logo_tone": "LIGHT",
        "footer_tone": "NAVY",
        "accent": "GOLD"
      },
      {
        "index": 4,
        "text": "She was not operating from a master blueprint?she was thirty-two, figuring out dinner and rent in real time.",
        "closing": false,
        "text_tone": "LIGHT",
        "logo_tone": "LIGHT",
        "footer_tone": "NAVY",
        "accent": "GOLD"
      },
      {
        "index": 5,
        "text": "Maturity is rarely a settled state achieved in the past. It is mostly the quiet effort of keeping going while the paint dries.",
        "closing": true,
        "text_tone": "LIGHT",
        "logo_tone": "LIGHT",
        "footer_tone": "NAVY",
        "accent": "GOLD"
      }
    ],
